  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "You are given an array AAA of size NNN such that Ai=0A_i = 0Ai​=0 initially, for all 1≤i≤N1\\le i \\le N1≤i≤N.\n\nYou have MMM enemies and each enemy will blast one bomb on an index. The ithi^{th}ith enemy (1≤i≤M)(1\\le i \\le M)(1≤i≤M) will place their bomb at index XiX_iXi​, and the bomb will have a range of YiY_iYi​.\n\nThis means that, due to the ithi^{th}ith bomb, all indices in the range [Xi−Yi,Xi+Yi][X_i-Y_i, X_i+Y_i][Xi​−Yi​,Xi​+Yi​] might be affected:\n\n\nFor indices jjj, (max(1,Xi−Yi)≤j&lt;Xi)(\\texttt{max} (1, X_i - Y_i) \\le j \\lt X_i)(max(1,Xi​−Yi​)≤j&lt;Xi​), the value at the jthj^{th}jth index **decreases** by (Xi−j)⋅(Xi−j+1)(X_i - j)\\cdot (X_i - j + 1)(Xi​−j)⋅(Xi​−j+1).\nFor indices kkk, (Xi&lt;k≤min(N,Xi+Yi))(X_i \\lt k \\le \\texttt{min} (N, X_i + Y_i))(Xi​&lt;k≤min(N,Xi​+Yi​)), the value at the kthk^{th}kth index **increases** by (k−Xi)⋅(k−Xi+1)(k-X_i)\\cdot (k - X_i + 1)(k−Xi​)⋅(k−Xi​+1).\nThe value at the Xith{X_i}^{th}Xi​th index remains as it is.\nFind the resultant array after all bombs blast.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line of input will contain a single integer TTT, denoting the number of test cases.\nEach test case consists of multiple lines of input.\n\nThe first line of each test case contains two space-separated integers N,MN, MN,M - the size of the array and the total number of bomb blasts, respectively.\nThe next MMM lines of each test case contains two space-separated integers Xi,YiX_i, Y_iXi​,Yi​ - index at which the bomb will blast and the range of the bomb, respectively.\n\n\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, print NNN space-separated integers, denoting the resultant array after all bombs blast.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤1051 \\leq T \\leq 10^{5}1≤T≤105",
      "1≤N,M≤2×1051 \\leq N, M \\leq 2\\times 10^{5}1≤N,M≤2×105",
      "1≤Xi,Yi≤N1 \\leq X_i, Y_i \\leq N1≤Xi​,Yi​≤N",
      "The sum of NNN over all test cases won't exceed 2⋅1052\\cdot 10^{5}2⋅105.",
      "The sum of MMM over all test cases won't exceed 2⋅1052\\cdot 10^{5}2⋅105."
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
